templates below are in scope. No free natural-language implication, hidden fact payload, or unlisted template is asserted.\"\n  },\n  \"source_hashes\": {\n    \"game-track/godot/scripts/sealed_lighthouse_machine.gd\": \"48da35d485473abfa9805e0dddb80d6aa6bad5c0bd183c57541886e768f839c1\",\n    \"game-track/godot/data/sealed_lighthouse.json\": \"f262455e57be7204f5f597736a89379f37f3f698475fa745a48be6ef2ebb28d9\",\n    \"game-track/godot/scripts/evidence_capture_runner.gd\": \"c11bdebcc2a8b69e8d69b64958a449016038481e08be158f07b19ce01da3846e\",\n    \"game-track/godot/scripts/game3d/game_3d.gd\": \"a17361b8f17fbfd6392ebcd754dbc89ccb1b9a57e016108a0fc667a076c6cfd0\",\n    \".ouroboros/seeds/seed-20261023-npc-disclosure-37ffdf78a47d.yaml\": \"3e601c02f44f64c90715254a9376e7c97c638f92dd27479ecb1e3df7592b81e2\",\n    \"llm-wiki/wiki/reports/2026-10-22-ontology-signals-interview.md\": \"6ac3c97d539f09ca148704388cdd063d7d80143e0444222712212e1f15a9133d\"\n  },\n  \"declaration_derivation\": {\n    \"actor_axis\": \"The scenario declares one NPC key captain_mira; the runtime binding and approved action arguments also name captain_mira.\",\n    \"fact_axis\": \"The four IDs are the ordered union of initial_state.facts and captain_mira.knowledge, deduplicated; keeper_betrayal remains an ID only and no secret payload is included.\",\n    \"stage_axis\": \"The initial quest stage is 0 and the sole stage gate declares tide_marks_hint minimum_stage 2; normal strata are 0, 1, and 2. -1 and 3 are boundary-only probes.\",\n    \"knowledge_axis\": \"Each normal case toggles whether the requested canonical ID is present in the actor knowledge declaration; this is a state fixture axis, not a claim about a new NPC.\",\n    \"prior_disclosure_axis\": \"Each normal case toggles whether the requested canonical ID is already in actor disclosed. A true value is a redisplay request and must still recheck current policy/actor/knowledge.\",\n    \"decision_order\": \"Evaluate policy codes first; if any policy code exists, return that set and do not evaluate actor/knowledge. Otherwise reject unknown actor, then reject missing actor knowledge. Code arrays are compared as sets semantically.\",\n    \"allow_rule\": \"Allow iff the requested ID is not permanently forbidden, every stage gate for it is satisfied, actor is eligible, and actor knows the ID.\",\n    \"first_disclosure_effect\": \"For an allowed request with prior_disclosed=false, disclose exactly the requested canonical fact. For tide_marks_hint only, add the declared relationship-memory entry turn-05:mira-shared-tide-marks-hint; for dock_saved and lighthouse_dark, add no relationship-memory entry because no such declaration exists. Preserve stage and increase revision once.\",\n    \"redisplay_effect\": \"For an allowed request with prior_disclosed=true, return the same approved template but do not mutate facts, actor.disclosed, relationship_memory, revision, or canonical state hash.\",\n    \"deny_effect\": \"For any denied request, add no requested fact or approved dialogue assertion and preserve the complete canonical state. The safe fallback template is the only denial display assertion.\"\n  },\n  \"approved_templates\": [\n    {\n      \"template_id\": \"mira-safe-deflection-v1\",\n      \"kind\": \"deny_fallback\",\n      \"source\": \"game-track/godot/data/sealed_lighthouse.json:safe_fallback\",\n      \"text_en\": \"Mira studies the dark tower and asks you to recover the signal lens first.\",\n      \"text_ko\": \"미라는 어두운 탑을 바라보며 먼저 신호 렌즈를 회수해 달라고 말한다.\",\n      \"permitted_for\": \"all denied cases\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"template_id\": \"sl-rc-003-authorized-hint\",\n      \"kind\": \"authorized_disclosure\",\n      \"source\": \"game-track/godot/scripts/evidence_capture_runner.gd:30-40\",\n      \"capture_id\": \"sl-rc-003-authorized-hint\",\n      \"title\": \"AUTHORIZED HINT / COMMIT\",\n      \"narrative\": \"The restored lens authorizes Mira's tide-marks hint.\",\n      \"status\": \"COMMIT · REPLAY-BOUND\",\n      \"permitted_for\": \"fresh or redisplayed tide_marks_hint when all authorization conditions pass\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rule_ids\": {\n    \"DISC-001\": \"permanently_forbidden fact is always denied\",\n    \"DISC-002\": \"stage-gated fact is denied below minimum stage\",\n    \"DISC-003\": \"only captain_mira is an eligible actor\",\n    \"DISC-004\": \"eligible actor must know the requested fact\",\n    \"DISC-005\": \"fresh allowed disclosure adds the requested canonical fact and disclosed ID; tide_marks_hint additionally adds the declared relationship-memory entry; stage is preserved\",\n    \"DISC-006\": \"allowed redisplay rechecks current authorization and has no canonical mutation\",\n    \"DISC-007\": \"denial preserves canonical state and emits only the safe fallback template\"\n  },\n  \"normal_cases\": [\n    {\"case_id\":\"N-001\",\"actor_id\":\"captain_mira\",\"fact_id\":\"dock_saved\",\"stage\":0,\"knows\":false,\"prior_disclosed\":false,\"expected\":{\"allowed\":false,\"codes\":[\"NPC_DOES_NOT_KNOW_FACT\"],\"template_id\":\"mira-safe-deflection-v1\",\"rule_ids\":[\"DISC-004\",\"DISC-007\"]}},\n    {\"case_id\":\"N-002\",\"actor_id\":\"captain_mira\",\"fact_id\":\"dock_saved\",\"stage\":0,\"knows\":false,\"prior_disclosed\":true,\"expected\":{\"allowed\":false,\"codes\":[\"NPC_DOES_NOT_KNOW_FACT\"],\"template_id\":\"mira-safe-deflection-v1\",\"rule_ids\":[\"DISC-004\",\"DISC-007\"]}},\n    {\"case_id\":\"N-003\",\"actor_id\":\"captain_mira\",\"fact_id\":\"dock_saved\",\"stage\":0,\"knows\":true,\"prior_disclosed\":false,\"expected\":{\"allowed\":true,\"codes\":[],\"template_id\":null,\"state_effect\":\"fresh_disclosure\",\"rule_ids\":[\"DISC-005\"]}},\n    {\"case_id\":\"N-004\",\"actor_id\":\"captain_mira\",\"fact_id\":\"dock_saved\",\"stage\":0,\"knows\":true,\"prior_disclosed\":true,\"expected\":{\"allowed\":true,\"codes\":[],\"template_id\":null,\"state_effect\":\"redisplay_no_mutation\",\"rule_ids\":[\"DISC-006\"]}},\n 